    skos:definition "Trade poster sizes in centimetres — square and portrait sizes matched to common frames (25 × 25 up to 100 × 140), alongside the ISO and US series."@da,
        "Handelsübliche Plakatformate in Zentimetern — quadratische und hochformatige Maße für gängige Rahmen (25 × 25 bis 100 × 140), neben den ISO- und US-Reihen."@de,
        "Trade poster sizes in centimetres — square and portrait sizes matched to common frames (25 × 25 up to 100 × 140), alongside the ISO and US series."@en,
        "Trade poster sizes in centimetres — square and portrait sizes matched to common frames (25 × 25 up to 100 × 140), alongside the ISO and US series."@es,
